<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>It was alone the Savior stood</l><l>In Pilate’s judgment hall;</l><l>Alone the crown of thorns He wore,</l><l>Forsaken thus by all.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Alone upon the cross He hung</l><l>That others He might save;</l><l>Forsaken then by God and man.</l><l>Alone, His life He gave.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Can you reject such matchless love?</l><l>Can you His claim disown?</l><l>Come, give your all in gratitude,</l><l>Nor leave Him thus alone.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
